  "conclusion": "corresponds",
  "rationale": "program_safety assumes well-formed classes, SequenceTyped from the empty environment, and an arbitrary finite execution prefix from empty storage. It concludes not stuck, finished-or-step, and a counted completion with prefix length plus remaining statement count equal to the original count, along with final Realizes. This proves the prose's extendibility and exact total step count for every prefix, retaining final storage. It makes no destruction/termination-of-resources claim; all judgments have been introduced in configurations, progress and preservation.",
